feat(config): add EstimatorConfig for YAML-based estimator configuration

Add a Pydantic model (EstimatorConfig) that validates, serializes, and
deserializes scikit-learn compatible estimators to/from YAML files.

- EstimatorConfig with build(), from_estimator(), to_yaml(), from_yaml()
- YAML inheritance via anchors/merge keys and include tag
- Trusted-module allowlist for secure class resolution
- Recursive nested estimator support
- Optional dependency extra: sklearn_wrap[config]
- 45 new tests, marimo example notebook, user-guide docs
